ggtree only implement equal-angle algorithm and do have this problem.

ape implemented more complex algorithm and can use more space.

You can use ape‘s node position in ggtree.
plot(x, type='unrooted')

p = ggtree(x, layout='unrooted')
xx = get("last_plot.phylo", envir=.PlotPhyloEnv)
p$data$y = xx$yy
p$data$x = xx$xx

p
​

